---
// Home page copy lives in this file.
// The big banner is src/assets/photos/44bar-hero.jpg.
// Animal photos: see src/assets/photos/README.md.
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import PhotoSlot from '../components/PhotoSlot.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
import hero from '../assets/photos/44bar-hero.jpg';
---

<Page title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION}>
	<section class="hero" slot="hero">
		<h1 class="sr-only">44 Bar Ranch</h1>
		<Picture
			src={hero}
			formats={['avif', 'webp']}
			alt="Hereford bull beside the 44 Bar Ranch brand"
			layout="full-width"
			widths={[480, 768, 1024, 1280]}
			sizes="100vw"
			loading="eager"
			fetchpriority="high"
			pictureAttributes={{ class: 'hero-picture' }}
		/>
	</section>

	<p class="tagline">
		Eggs most mornings, cattle on the grass, and a dog who thinks he runs the place.
	</p>

	<section class="intro">
		<h2>The short version</h2>
		<p class="lede">
			44 Bar Ranch is a small family place in rural Texas. The days start with the chickens,
			because the chickens start whether anybody is ready or not. Turkeys live here too. So do
			cattle, and a few ranch dogs who take the job more seriously than the job asked them to.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="animals">
		<h2>Who lives here</h2>
		<div class="animal-grid">
			<article class="animal-card">
				<PhotoSlot name="chickens" alt="Chickens at 44 Bar Ranch" />
				<h3>Chickens</h3>
				<p>
					The hens keep the only schedule on the place that actually holds. Eggs most days. If
					the basket is full, the morning went all right.
				</p>
			</article>
			<article class="animal-card">
				<PhotoSlot name="turkeys" alt="Turkeys at 44 Bar Ranch" />
				<h3>Turkeys</h3>
				<p>
					Turkeys have opinions, and they share all of them. They are part of the yard anyway,
					noise included.
				</p>
			</article>
			<article class="animal-card">
				<PhotoSlot name="cattle" alt="Cattle at 44 Bar Ranch" />
				<h3>Cattle</h3>
				<p>
					The cattle handle the pasture. They are not in a hurry, and around here that counts as
					a skill.
				</p>
			</article>
			<article class="animal-card">
				<PhotoSlot name="dogs" alt="Ranch dogs at 44 Bar Ranch" />
				<h3>Ranch dogs</h3>
				<p>
					The dogs have appointed themselves management. Gates, strangers, and anything with
					feathers fall under their watch. Pay is a porch and supper.
				</p>
			</article>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="blog-cta">
		<div>
			<h2>Notes from the place</h2>
			<p>When something out here is worth telling, it goes on the blog. No newsletter. No fuss.</p>
		</div>
		<a class="button" href="/blog">Read the blog</a>
	</section>
</Page>
